y: none;\"></div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed buffEffect&#95;&#95;KannonbirakiBenihimeAratame H(100%) W(100%)\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Kisoko\" style=\"display: none;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h3><span id=\"Upgrade_2_-_5.2C000.C2.A5_2\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Upgrade_2_-_5,000¥_2\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between;\"><span>Upgrade 2 - <span class=\"game-font-face Tsh(Game) C(Yen)\">5,000¥</span></span> <span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"font-size: 90%; align-self: center; gap: 9px; display: flex; padding: 0 9px;\"> </span></div></span></h3>\n<ul><li>+ Lights<br />-15% Cost<br />+10% DMG</li>   </ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-statsBox\">\n<div class=\"Stats-Box stats\" id=\"Stats-Box-OFF\">\n<div class=\"buffEffect&#95;&#95;box H(100%) W(100%)\">\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed buffEffect&#95;&#95;SakuroAuraBuff H(100%) W(100%)\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Sakura\" style=\"display: none;\"></div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed buffEffect&#95;&#95;SkyEnchantment H(100%) W(100%)\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Sasageyo\" style=\"display: none;\"></div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed buffEffect&#95;&#95;KannonbirakiBenihimeAratame H(100%) W(100%)\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Kisoko\" style=\"display: none;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h3><span id=\"Upgrade_3_-_7.2C500.C2.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Upgrade_3_-_7,500¥\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between;\"><span>Upgrade 3 - <span class=\"game-font-face Tsh(Game) C(Yen)\">7,500¥</span></span> <span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"font-size: 90%; align-self: center; gap: 9px; display: flex; padding: 0 9px;\"> </span></div></span></h3>\n<ul><li>+ Concert<br />-20% Cost<br />+15% DMG</li>   </ul>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-statsBox\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"Stats-Box\" id=\"Stats-Box-ON\">\n<div class=\"buffEffect&#95;&#95;box H(100%) W(100%)\">\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed buffEffect&#95;&#95;SakuroAuraBuff H(100%) W(100%)\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Sakura\" style=\"display: none;\"></div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed buffEffect&#95;&#95;SkyEnchantment H(100%) W(100%)\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Sasageyo\" style=\"display: none;\"></div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed buffEffect&#95;&#95;KannonbirakiBenihimeAratame H(100%) W(100%)\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Kisoko\" style=\"display: none;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h3><span id=\"Upgrade_3_-_7.2C500.C2.A5_2\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Upgrade_3_-_7,500¥_2\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between;\"><span>Upgrade 3 - <span class=\"game-font-face Tsh(Game) C(Yen)\">7,500¥</span></span> <span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"font-size: 90%; align-self: center; gap: 9px; display: flex; padding: 0 9px;\"> </span></div></span></h3>\n<ul><li>+ Concert<br />-20% Cost<br />+15% DMG</li>   </ul>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"click-on-I-Box&#95;&#95;Container\">\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-statsBox\">\n<div class=\"click-on-I-Box\" id=\"click-on-I-Box-OFF\">⁣⁣⁣⁣click on any part of the information block</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-statsBox\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"click-on-I-Box\" id=\"click-on-I-Box-ON\">⁣⁣⁣⁣click on any part of the information block</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Selling\">Selling</span></h2>\n<p>This unit cannot be sold.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<p>Idol (Star) has the ability to lower the cost of upgrading your units and also give a Damage Boost to any of your units you place <b>no matter where she is</b> placed on the map.\n</p>\n<ul><li>This cannot stack with <a href=\"/wiki/Blossom\" title=\"Blossom\">Blossom</a> buffs.</li>\n<li>This buff stacks additionally with <a href=\"/wiki/Commander\" title=\"Commander\">Commander</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wind_Dragon\" title=\"Wind Dragon\">Wind Dragon</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Griffin_(Reincarnation)\" title=\"Griffin (Reincarnation)\">Griffin (Reincarnation)</a>'s buffs</li>\n<li>Note that her normal version isn't even limited. She's the first unit to do so.</li>\n<li>She is the first unit to have her banner version after debuting as a battlepass unit.</li>\n<li>During Update 12.5.0, she had issues with <a href=\"/wiki/Trickster_(Release)\" title=\"Trickster (Release)\">Trickster (Release)</a>.</li>\n<li>As of Update 15, she, <a href=\"/wiki/Blossom\" title=\"Blossom\">Blossom</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Skeleton_(Soul_King)\" title=\"Skeleton (Soul King)\">Skeleton (Soul King)</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Griffin_(Reincarnation)\" title=\"Griffin (Reincarnation)\">Griffin (Reincarnation)</a> are the only ones capable of buffing both Physical and Magical damage.\n<ul><li>She's the only one who can only affect the user's own units.</li></ul></li>\n<li>From update 19.5, she can negate High Cost debuffs, which is not affected by High Cost stages and reduced the placement cost of other units to normal state.</li>\n<li>This is the first unit to be able to reduce upgrade costs, making her very useful for High Cost stages.</li>\n<li>Golden trait has cost reduction of 6% at deployment, 12% at upgrade 1, 18% at upgrade 2, 24% at upgrade 3.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>This is the first unit to have 2 shiny variants, one from the cake hunt battlepass and one from the banner</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022124626\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.123 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.174 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1133/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78538/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument siz